  "body": "> this specification requires that only secure contexts as described in [powerful-features] can access USB devices.\r\n\r\nfile:// is a Potentially Trustworthy origin, but it's currently being disallowed by Chromium/Chrome.\r\n\r\nWill this be not specified further and up to Browser implementers? Do you think this is the right choice from Chrome?",
